{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> have the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71ade8e3d02f43830891759e290f03406b7a777a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{b} 729$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> is a positive integer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/2/112e29de497e42cd4612addaf17d301844a116ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 0 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 1 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 2 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 3 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 4 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecb70349f636f749b4f7d250192096514b259c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\log_{b} 729$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/5/2f57a56287ef56056d826bf99d418122ae7aadcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^n = 729 = 3^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"17\" />.  \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be a power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba1d80f85320b1533c446a2d953c8a15c204de5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/5607f0c35bc86ff730c3b801ce0f154eece2e053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3^a)^n = 3^{an} = 3^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a1af7cb9c0af2866bb83f269de72082417bbf1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$an = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cfee828b9370c1573c179968614b428c45b7850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\{1, 2, 3, 6\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaafc5e73aa3405c7a6e69dd616268c569110725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\in \\{3, 9, 27, 729\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420eb4362326f8089ce352b60312f07889d512b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" /> possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p3bwMuK1RUM?si=KWRsbwzVa2Z8MN69&amp;t=157\">https://youtu.be/p3bwMuK1RUM?si=KWRsbwzVa2Z8MN69&amp;t=157</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4\"